Dialogue: 0,1:05:31.25,1:05:32.72,ASS,,0,0,0,,很好
Dialogue: 0,1:05:34.52,1:05:36.25,ASS,,0,0,0,,害羞
Dialogue: 0,1:05:40.60,1:05:41.79,ASS,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:05:44.40,1:05:46.20,ASS,,0,0,0,,好棒啊
Dialogue: 0,1:05:54.74,1:05:56.01,ASS,,0,0,0,,真是漂亮啊
Dialogue: 0,1:06:12.83,1:06:14.23,ASS,,0,0,0,,这里呢
Dialogue: 0,1:06:16.57,1:06:18.23,ASS,,0,0,0,,这样呢
Dialogue: 0,1:06:38.92,1:06:43.26,ASS,,0,0,0,,这样很爽吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:01.08,1:07:06.67,ASS,,0,0,0,,我kiss都没有过\N就要死了
Dialogue: 0,1:07:16.69,1:07:20.63,ASS,,0,0,0,,医生不会是第一次吧
Dialogue: 0,1:07:22.90,1:07:24.49,ASS,,0,0,0,,真是荣幸啊
Dialogue: 0,1:11:18.47,1:11:20.06,ASS,,0,0,0,,怎么了
Dialogue: 0,1:11:23.87,1:11:25.34,ASS,,0,0,0,,蟹足
Dialogue: 0,1:13:54.42,1:13:56.22,ASS,,0,0,0,,脱掉吧
Dialogue: 0,1:14:30.86,1:14:33.92,ASS,,0,0,0,,这么打开
Dialogue: 0,1:14:34.40,1:14:35.99,ASS,,0,0,0,,好棒啊
Dialogue: 0,1:14:43.87,1:14:45.47,ASS,,0,0,0,,打开很爽吧
Dialogue: 0,1:14:49.55,1:14:52.07,ASS,,0,0,0,,是不是
Dialogue: 0,1:14:59.89,1:15:02.08,ASS,,0,0,0,,打开着
Dialogue: 0,1:15:17.51,1:15:20.30,ASS,,0,0,0,,很爽吧
Dialogue: 0,1:15:28.12,1:15:29.18,ASS,,0,0,0,,真棒啊
Dialogue: 0,1:16:49.47,1:16:51.66,ASS,,0,0,0,,舒服吗
Dialogue: 0,1:16:58.47,1:17:00.60,ASS,,0,0,0,,很爽吧
Dialogue: 0,1:17:08.22,1:17:09.95,ASS,,0,0,0,,这里呢
Dialogue: 0,1:18:06.41,1:18:08.47,ASS,,0,0,0,,想要吗
Dialogue: 0,1:18:09.61,1:18:13.01,ASS,,0,0,0,,想要男人了吗
Dialogue: 0,1:18:15.55,1:18:21.22,ASS,,0,0,0,,我想要了
Dialogue: 0,1:18:23.96,1:18:26.36,ASS,,0,0,0,,想要硬硬的肉棒吗
Dialogue: 0,1:18:30.57,1:18:32.83,ASS,,0,0,0,,要看吗
Dialogue: 0,1:18:40.04,1:18:44.31,ASS,,0,0,0,,让我好好爽一下吧
